  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6af5edff8cfb3a06",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face，我们正在为深度强化学习研究者和爱好者的生态贡献力量。最近，我们集成了 Stable-Baselines3 等深度 RL 框架。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f7276cd014eda3e",
      "translationZh": "今天我们高兴地宣布：离线强化学习方法 Decision Transformer 已集成进 🤗 transformers 库和 Hugging Face Hub。对于提升深度 RL 领域的可及性，我们有一些令人兴奋的计划，期待在未来几周和几个月里与大家分享。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d01f2fc57c97b113",
      "translationZh": "什么是离线强化学习？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ca9873aef4751eb",
      "translationZh": "认识 Decision Transformers",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "054d8f37cc3494a0",
      "translationZh": "在 🤗 Transformers 中使用 Decision Transformer",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ff1257d106c90a9",
      "translationZh": "下一步？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d01f2fc57c97b113",
      "translationZh": "什么是离线强化学习？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73a250698733e038",
      "translationZh": "深度强化学习（RL）是构建决策智能体的框架。这些智能体的目标是通过与环境反复试错的交互、并以奖励作为唯一反馈，学到最优行为（策略）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa6d3f7f4b02aaf6",
      "translationZh": "智能体的目标是最大化其累积奖励，即回报（return）。因为 RL 建立在奖励假说之上：一切目标都可以描述为期望累积奖励的最大化。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "587d79d470f0bd61",
      "translationZh": "深度强化学习智能体用成批的经验学习。问题是，这些经验从哪来？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "255b48b7ce9208ba",
      "translationZh": "在线与离线强化学习的对比，图取自这篇文章",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b90733e72a2dea8",
      "translationZh": "在线强化学习中，智能体自己采集数据：它通过与环境交互收集一批经验，然后立即（或经由某个回放缓冲区）用这些经验学习（更新策略）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04fd483faa23db68",
      "translationZh": "但这意味着你要么直接在真实世界里训练智能体，要么拥有一个模拟器。如果没有，就得自己造——这可能非常复杂（如何在环境中反映真实世界的复杂现实？）、昂贵，而且不安全：一旦模拟器有缺陷，只要能带来竞争优势，智能体就会钻空子。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe868a7ee083b8a6",
      "translationZh": "另一方面，在离线强化学习中，智能体只使用从其他智能体或人类示范中收集的数据，不与环境交互。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15823aabbf0a0b2b",
      "translationZh": "流程如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5a94f591778b11f",
      "translationZh": "用一个或多个策略和/或人类交互创建数据集。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d0b5b2f00e83e0a",
      "translationZh": "在该数据集上运行离线 RL，学出一个策略。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d42cfa0681b781ea",
      "translationZh": "这种方法有一个缺点：反事实查询问题。如果智能体决定做一件我们没有数据的事怎么办？比如在路口右转，但我们没有这条轨迹。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a4d10ac85124422",
      "translationZh": "针对这个主题已有一些解决方案；想进一步了解离线强化学习，可以看这个视频。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ca9873aef4751eb",
      "translationZh": "认识 Decision Transformers",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37f023267d54e9d3",
      "translationZh": "Decision Transformer 模型由 Chen L. 等人的论文《Decision Transformer: Reinforcement Learning via Sequence Modeling》提出。它把强化学习抽象为条件序列建模问题。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c53d0db8b38e81e5",
      "translationZh": "核心思想是：不再用 RL 方法（如拟合价值函数）训练一个告诉我们采取什么动作能最大化回报的策略，而是用一个序列建模算法（Transformer）：给定期望回报、历史状态和动作，它将生成未来的动作来实现这个期望回报。这是一个以期望回报、历史状态和动作为条件的自回归模型，生成能达到期望回报的未来动作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "894f79b375b6a2bd",
      "translationZh": "这是强化学习范式的彻底转变：我们用生成式的轨迹建模（对状态、动作、奖励序列的联合分布建模）取代了传统 RL 算法。这意味着在 Decision Transformer 中，我们不再最大化回报，而是生成一系列能达到期望回报的未来动作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b6152f4c1a866d3",
      "translationZh": "流程是这样的：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac09b30f5c509ad",
      "translationZh": "我们把最近 K 个时间步连同 3 种输入喂给 Decision Transformer：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8251467d5d1b3fcf",
      "translationZh": "Return-to-go（待达成回报）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3b50c476732c740",
      "translationZh": "状态",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64cff1319d2fd2cb",
      "translationZh": "动作",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99b62bb44aeb20fc",
      "translationZh": "这些 token 的嵌入：状态是向量时用线性层，是图像帧时用 CNN 编码器。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83a4810321bc26e4",
      "translationZh": "输入由 GPT-2 模型处理，通过自回归建模预测未来动作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2463dc2d0e329ca",
      "translationZh": "Decision Transformer 架构。状态、动作与回报被送入各自模态的线性嵌入，并加上按回合的位置时间步编码。这些 token 输入 GPT 架构，使用因果自注意力掩码自回归地预测动作。图取自 [1]。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "054d8f37cc3494a0",
      "translationZh": "在 🤗 Transformers 中使用 Decision Transformer",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3df7eccc9aa50207",
      "translationZh": "Decision Transformer 模型现已作为 🤗 transformers 库的一部分提供。此外，我们分享了九个针对 Gym 环境连续控制任务的预训练模型检查点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80e935ff39545c3b",
      "translationZh": "一个在 Gym Walker2d 环境中用离线 RL 训练的“专家”级 Decision Transformer 模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "936df3873b172e6c",
      "translationZh": "安装软件包",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7f926764699b07ae",
      "translationZh": "加载模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4ac2a9b7f508de0",
      "translationZh": "使用 Decision Transformer 相对简单，但由于它是自回归模型，在每个时间步准备模型输入时需要留心。我们准备了一个 Python 脚本和一个 Colab notebook 来演示如何使用这个模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15e977818f81d832",
      "translationZh": "在 🤗 transformers 库中加载预训练的 Decision Transformer 非常简单：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1565f6862f9e133b",
      "translationZh": "创建环境",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b453e5ac970c1b52",
      "translationZh": "我们为 Gym 的 Hopper、Walker2D 和 HalfCheetah 提供了预训练检查点，Atari 环境的检查点也将很快推出。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18892f3577bd0f77",
      "translationZh": "自回归预测函数",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b2e47a0c1ca0e9",
      "translationZh": "模型执行的是自回归预测：当前时间步 t 的预测以前面各时间步的输出为条件依序生成。这个函数内容相当多，我们会在注释里尽量解释。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c410b808b7c82c57",
      "translationZh": "评估模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23eb55634134842f",
      "translationZh": "评估模型还需要一些附加信息：训练时所用状态的均值和标准差。幸运的是，Hugging Face Hub 上每个检查点的模型卡都提供了它们！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e92af05d1e871d9d",
      "translationZh": "我们还需要为模型设定一个目标回报。这正是回报条件化离线强化学习的威力所在：我们可以用目标回报控制策略的表现。这在多人场景中会非常强大——比如想让对手机器人的表现调整到适合玩家的难度。作者在论文中展示了一张精彩的图！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "559da3454e62149c",
      "translationZh": "Decision Transformer 在指定目标（期望）回报条件下累积的采样（评估）回报。上：Atari。下：D4RL medium-replay 数据集。图取自 [1]。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "062ba10f7991c445",
      "translationZh": "更详细的示例（包括生成智能体的视频）见我们的 Colab notebook。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66039eddea739c04",
      "translationZh": "除 Decision Transformers 之外，我们还希望支持深度强化学习社区的更多用例和工具。因此，非常希望听到你对 Decision Transformer 模型的反馈，以及更广泛地说，任何我们能与你一起构建、对 RL 有用的东西。欢迎联系我们。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ad7aa27712dc30e",
      "translationZh": "下一步？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51e1a726a8beb3e3",
      "translationZh": "未来几周和几个月，我们计划支持生态中的其他工具：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1a4139547d686be",
      "translationZh": "集成 RL-baselines3-zoo",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "890fa0d612c2ca40",
      "translationZh": "把用 RL 训练的智能体模型上传到 Hub：一大批准使用 stable-baselines3 的预训练强化学习智能体",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "772d6d62d61c7e52",
      "translationZh": "集成其他深度强化学习库",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ca7e3349739ce6f",
      "translationZh": "为 Atari 实现卷积版 Decision Transformer",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff153d12d7590438",
      "translationZh": "还有更多 🥳",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5efb569421afcaf6",
      "translationZh": "保持联系的最佳方式是加入我们的 discord 服务器，与我们和社区交流。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
